    "abstract": "We present a low-cost soil-moisture-driven irrigation controller that communicates over LoRa. A four-week field trial shows a 34% reduction in water use compared with a fixed timer, at under 60 USD per zone.",
    "keywords": "irrigation, LoRa, soil moisture, embedded systems",
    "funding": "This work was supported in part by the Example University Senior Design Fund."
  },
  "bibliography": "@article{allen1998,\n  author  = {Allen, Richard G. and Pereira, Luis S. and Raes, Dirk and Smith, Martin},\n  title   = {Crop Evapotranspiration: Guidelines for Computing Crop Water Requirements},\n  journal = {FAO Irrigation and Drainage Paper},\n  volume  = {56},\n  year    = {1998},\n  publisher = {FAO}\n}\n\n@inproceedings{smith2021,\n  author    = {Smith, Jane and Okafor, Chidi},\n  title     = {Low-Power Soil Sensing for Smallholder Farms},\n  booktitle = {Proceedings of the IEEE Global Humanitarian Technology Conference},\n  pages     = {112--118},\n  year      = {2021}\n}\n\n@misc{lora2019,\n  author       = {{LoRa Alliance}},\n  title        = {{LoRaWAN} Specification v1.0.3},\n  year         = {2019},\n  howpublished = {LoRa Alliance Technical Committee}\n}\n",
  "doc": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1,
          "id": "s-intro"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Introduction"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Low-power wide-area networks make it possible to monitor farms far from cellular coverage "
          },
          {
            "type": "citation",
            "attrs": {
              "keys": [
                "lora2019"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". This article evaluates a soil-moisture controller built on such a network; "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "attrs": {
              "target": "s-results"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " reports a field trial."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1,
          "id": "s-methods"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Methods"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Water demand follows the FAO-56 crop model "
          },
          {
            "type": "citation",
            "attrs": {
              "keys": [
                "allen1998"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", which estimates the daily deficit as in "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "attrs": {
              "target": "eq-deficit"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ":"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "equation",
        "attrs": {
          "latex": "D_t = D_{t-1} + ET_c - P_{\\mathrm{eff}} - I_t",
          "id": "eq-deficit"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "figure",
        "attrs": {
